{"4963640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bad Pig House", "steam_appid": 4963640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5100940], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wolf blew down Hryundel’s home and took his family from him. Grandpa didn’t last much longer. With his final breath, he handed his grandson the family heirloom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not wisdom. Not a treasure map. <strong>A massive sledgehammer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good thing he didn’t have to wait long to try it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4963640/extras/bec764800e480c3ef10ade3cb93fb790.poster.avif?t=1788299394\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4963640/extras/bec764800e480c3ef10ade3cb93fb790.webm?t=1788299394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4963640/extras/bec764800e480c3ef10ade3cb93fb790.mp4?t=1788299394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, the hammer turns Hryundel into something close to a pig god. Trees fall, rocks crack, and anything that isn’t nailed down becomes building material.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before sunset, you need to build a house. Preferably a strong one. But anything that survives the wolf’s first sneeze will do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4963640/extras/b672812afeced837a13c7e198f250a06.poster.avif?t=1788299394\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4963640/extras/b672812afeced837a13c7e198f250a06.webm?t=1788299394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4963640/extras/b672812afeced837a13c7e198f250a06.mp4?t=1788299394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, the magic wears off. Hryundel becomes a small, vulnerable pig again—and the thing that destroyed his family comes back from the woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wolf huffs, puffs, smashes walls, kicks in doors, and searches for a way inside. Wall cracking? Repair it. Snout in the window? Grab the hammer. House collapsed? Our condolences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4963640/extras/0827fab3fa8aa9d067da7c93535523bc.poster.avif?t=1788299394\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4963640/extras/0827fab3fa8aa9d067da7c93535523bc.webm?t=1788299394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4963640/extras/0827fab3fa8aa9d067da7c93535523bc.mp4?t=1788299394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >free-form house building and fortification;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >crafting, workbench upgrades, and new defenses;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a procedural forest full of resources and local lunatics;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >destructible environments and a very large hammer;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >days when you’re almost a god and nights when you’re almost dinner;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >horror, absurd humor, and one suspiciously hungry wolf;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >first-person and third-person gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The wolf wants dinner. Hryundel wants revenge. Between them stand a few badly nailed planks.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wolf blew down Hryundel’s home and took his family from him. Grandpa didn’t last much longer. With his final breath, he handed his grandson the family heirloom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not wisdom. Not a treasure map. <strong>A massive sledgehammer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good thing he didn’t have to wait long to try it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4963640/extras/bec764800e480c3ef10ade3cb93fb790.poster.avif?t=1788299394\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4963640/extras/bec764800e480c3ef10ade3cb93fb790.webm?t=1788299394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4963640/extras/bec764800e480c3ef10ade3cb93fb790.mp4?t=1788299394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, the hammer turns Hryundel into something close to a pig god. Trees fall, rocks crack, and anything that isn’t nailed down becomes building material.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before sunset, you need to build a house. Preferably a strong one. But anything that survives the wolf’s first sneeze will do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4963640/extras/b672812afeced837a13c7e198f250a06.poster.avif?t=1788299394\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4963640/extras/b672812afeced837a13c7e198f250a06.webm?t=1788299394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4963640/extras/b672812afeced837a13c7e198f250a06.mp4?t=1788299394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, the magic wears off. Hryundel becomes a small, vulnerable pig again—and the thing that destroyed his family comes back from the woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wolf huffs, puffs, smashes walls, kicks in doors, and searches for a way inside. Wall cracking? Repair it. Snout in the window? Grab the hammer. House collapsed? Our condolences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4963640/extras/0827fab3fa8aa9d067da7c93535523bc.poster.avif?t=1788299394\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4963640/extras/0827fab3fa8aa9d067da7c93535523bc.webm?t=1788299394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4963640/extras/0827fab3fa8aa9d067da7c93535523bc.mp4?t=1788299394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >free-form house building and fortification;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >crafting, workbench upgrades, and new defenses;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a procedural forest full of resources and local lunatics;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >destructible environments and a very large hammer;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >days when you’re almost a god and nights when you’re almost dinner;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >horror, absurd humor, and one suspiciously hungry wolf;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >first-person and third-person gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The wolf wants dinner. Hryundel wants revenge. Between them stand a few badly nailed planks.</strong></p>", "short_description": "A CRAZY HORROR GAME INSPIRED BY “THE THREE LITTLE PIGS”! GATHER RESOURCES, BUILD BEFORE SUNSET, AND SURVIVE THE NIGHT WITH THE WOLF!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, German, Indonesian, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4963640/10a3a84f4f9943b671438a76498237d95125b7ef/header.jpg?t=1788299394", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4963640/f909ef752f8ae8e69a8e0740cd0277330fd276e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788299394", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4963640/f909ef752f8ae8e69a8e0740cd0277330fd276e3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788299394", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel core i3<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750 Ti / GTX 950</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Team GZ"], "publishers": ["Team GZ"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 78, "description": "Adjustable Difficulty"}, {"id": 80, "description": "#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4963640/d68e4af4e9debc2ab8772f92550add3ed8697e70/ss_d68e4af4e9debc2ab8772f92550add